# Trivy ignores for the container image scan (.github/workflows/ci.yml, job `images`, and the
# release gate in .github/workflows/terraform.yml). Deliberately empty: every exception in
# .trivyignore is for a package that is in no image, so an advisory that reaches an image fails the
# scan at once. An image exception needs its own row in docs/compliance/vulnerability-exceptions.md
# and an entry here with an `exp:` date equal to its review date.
